OL,3,AFaisal Islam: Triple lock move is
OL,4,Asignificant, but it's a gamble
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was a significant announcement from
OL,7,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham on his
OL,8,Fplans for the triple lock after the
OL,9,Fgeneral election. It will reverberate
OL,10,Fwell beyond the hall.
OL,12,FFor months, I have heard suggestions
OL,13,Fthat Andy Burnham was warm to the idea
OL,14,Fthat the triple lock as we know it had
OL,15,Fto go.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,111,105,200,300,0,100
