OL,3,AFaisal Islam: Triple lock move is
OL,4,Asignificant, but it's a gamble
OL,5,
OL,6,FI had expected him to try to forge a
OL,7,Fpolitical consensus on this thorny
OL,8,Fissue at this stage, but he has gone
OL,9,Ffurther than that. He has tried to take
OL,10,Fthe sting out of the politics of his
OL,11,Fdecision by tying it to funding a new
OL,12,Fnational social care service.
OL,14,FThe government calls it an "adjusted
OL,15,Ftriple lock" as it is keen that
OL,16,Fpensioners are reassured. It is more
OL,17,Flike a double lock plus. The
OL,18,Fsensitivity over this political gamble
OL,19,Fis clear.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
